plicit -p/--protections list still wins; CLI\n--preset wins over obfuscation.json).","arguments":[{"name":"PRESET","required":true,"arity":{"minimum":1,"maximum":1},"metadata":[{"name":"ClrType","value":"System.String"}]}]},{"name":"--il2cpp","recursive":false,"hidden":false,"description":"Build the assembly for a Unity IL2CPP game: skip\nprotections that aren't IL2CPP-compatible (native code,\ncalli, PE packers, etc.) so the il2cpp.exe build doesn't\nbreak. Set automatically by the BitMono Unity\nintegration."},{"name":"--inspect-metadata","recursive":false,"hidden":false,"description":"Parse a Unity IL2CPP global-metadata.dat and print its\nversion + the names/literals it exposes, then exit.\nStandalone diagnostic; doesn't obfuscate.","arguments":[{"name":"INSPECTMETADATA","required":true,"arity":{"minimum":1,"maximum":1},"metadata":[{"name":"ClrType","value":"System.String"}]}]},{"name":"--encrypt-metadata","recursive":false,"hidden":false,"description":"Encrypt a Unity IL2CPP global-metadata.dat (writes\n<path>.enc) so static dumpers can't parse it. Requires\nthe matching native decryptor in GameAssembly.dll. See\n#276.","arguments":[{"name":"ENCRYPTMETADATA","required":true,"arity":{"minimum":1,"maximum":1},"metadata":[{"name":"ClrType","value":"System.String"}]}]},{"name":"--help","recursive":false,"hidden":false,"description":"Display this help screen."},{"name":"--version","recursive":false,"hidden":false,"description":"Display version information."}]}